<title>USA: AT&amp;T sets final stock distribution for Lucent.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T sets final stock distribution for Lucent.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Wednesday disclosed its final distribution for Lucent Technologies Inc shares, setting it at 0.324084 share of Lucent for each AT&amp;T share outstanding.</p>
<p>The distribution is scheduled for September 30. As of Tuesday night, AT&amp;T had 1,618,791,701 shares oustanding.</p>
<p>It will result in AT&amp;T shareholders receiving about 82.4 percent of the outstanding shares of Lucent Technologies common stock, the company said.  The other 17.6 percent of Lucent outstanding shares was sold to the public in April.  </p>
<p>Shareholders will receive stock certificates for whole shares and cash payments for fractional shares, the company said.</p>
</text>
